  "notes": "USAGE:\nA formal word. Common patterns include {庇護|ひご}を{受|う}ける (receive protection), {庇護|ひご}を{求|もと}める (seek asylum/protection), {庇護|ひご}のもとで (under the protection of). In international law and news, {庇護|ひご} is the standard term for \"asylum\" as in political asylum.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {庇護|ひご}を{受|う}ける: receive protection\n- {庇護|ひご}を{求|もと}める: seek asylum/protection\n- {庇護|ひご}{申請|しんせい}: asylum application\n- {庇護|ひご}のもとで: under the protection of",
